#: ../smart-base/processes/content/questionnaire-data-capture.bpmn:31
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A health worker completes one of the DAK's forms, a FHIR R4 Questionnaire conforming to Structured Data Capture, as their device renders it, and the point-of-care system turns the completed QuestionnaireResponse into the resources it stands for by the extraction the form declares (SDC $extract). Generic for any DAK: registering a client, recording a visit, a referral. A DAK's diagram calls it by call activity; the caller's lanes take on health-worker and point-of-care-system for the duration of the call. Skills: complete-sdc-questionnaire, extract-questionnaire-response (package authoring-who-smart-guidelines)."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/questionnaire-data-capture.bpmn:37
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A person in the health-worker role: completes the form with the client, confirming any pre-populated answer."
msgstr ""

